      "hints": [
        "Differentiate $y = (x - 1)^{1/2}$ to get $\\frac{dy}{dx} = \\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{x - 1}}$.",
        "Set $\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{x - 1}} = \\frac{1}{2} \\implies x = 2, y = 1$.",
        "Form tangent equation $y = \\frac{1}{2}x$."
